<title>UK: National Power H1 pretax profits slip.</title>
<headline>National Power H1 pretax profits slip.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ending September 30</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		16.5		   vs 16.2</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 6.0		    vs 5.4</p>
<p> Pretax, pre-exceps     251		    vs 254</p>
<p> Pretax		     194		    vs 254</p>
<p> Turnover		   1,596		  vs 1,668</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts' forecasts on pretax profits were in a range of 210 to 253 million stg. National Power said exceptional items of 57 million stg included an unrealised loss on its investment in and abortive acquisition costs of Southern Electric.</p>
</text>
